1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,710
Thirteen years of waiting...

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:04,880
and only three days left.

3
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,830
A child born the day GTA V came out...

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,510
is now a teenager, and still waiting.

5
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:14,470
This is Trend. On Thursday,

6
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:17,030
November 19th, GTA VI comes out,

7
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,520
the most awaited game in gaming history.

8
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:21,320
Its first trailer,

9
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,970
in December 2023,

10
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:25,850
broke a YouTube record.

11
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:29,400
More than 90 million views in a single day.

12
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,100
More than any non-music video before it.

13
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:34,040
Then the waiting began.

14
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,070
Players were promised fall 2025...

15
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:38,930
then it slipped to May...

16
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:41,280
then slipped again to November.

17
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:42,580
And the price?

18
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,910
Eighty dollars for the standard edition,

19
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,100
and a hundred dollars for the full edition.

20
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,640
The highest price for a main game in the series' history.

21
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:56,650
And yet, an estimated six million-plus digital copies were pre-ordered,

22
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,130
a month before release.

23
00:00:58,440 --> 00:01:00,000
Why all this madness?

24
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,720
The answer is in part five.

25
00:01:02,190 --> 00:01:04,420
On its first day,

26
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:07,150
it sold more than 800 million dollars.

27
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,430
And today, thirteen years later,

28
00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:12,940
its sales have passed 230 million copies...

29
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:15,870
and it is still selling.

30
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:17,530
That's why its owner,

31
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:21,080
Take-Two, expects more than 8 billion dollars this year,

32
00:01:21,410 --> 00:01:24,830
thanks to the new game. But before you pre-order,

33
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:25,750
watch out.

34
00:01:26,330 --> 00:01:29,650
The game comes out on PlayStation 5 and Xbox only.

35
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,770
No PC version for now.

36
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:34,640
And no online multiplayer on launch day.

37
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:36,980
It starts as a single-player story.

38
00:01:37,270 --> 00:01:38,810
Its heroes are Jason and Lucia,

39
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,650
in a fictional state called Leonida,

40
00:01:41,820 --> 00:01:43,620
inspired by Florida.

41
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:46,650
And pre-loading started on November 12th.

42
00:01:47,190 --> 00:01:47,930
The question now:

43
00:01:48,470 --> 00:01:50,960
is it worth thirteen years of waiting...

44
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,180
and eighty dollars?

45
00:01:52,930 --> 00:01:54,460
Tell me in the comments:

46
00:01:54,830 --> 00:01:57,050
day one, or will you wait?

47
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,990
Full sources in the video description.

48
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:01,110
Subscribe to the channel, and turn on the bell...

49
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:03,290
so you don't miss the next trend.

